flowchart TD
    S([Trip begins]) --> I[User informs supervisor by phone or message]
    I --> M[Supervisor relies on verbal updates]
    M --> Q{Delay or incident reported?}
    Q -- Yes --> F[Supervisor follows up manually]
    Q -- No --> U[Wait for next update]
    F --> U
    U --> Q
    Q -. Trip ends .-> E([Completion communicated manually])
